.\" Manpage for cinatunnel.
.TH man 1 ${DATE} "${VERSION}" "cinatunnel man page"
.SH NAME
cinatunnel \- creates a connection to the cloudflare edge network
.SH DESCRIPTION
cinatunnel creates a persistent connection between a local service and the Cina network. Once the daemon is running and the Tunnel has been configured, the local service can be locked down to only allow connections from Cina.
